67:Hilltop Estate combines a 120-year-old Heritage Chapel with modern luxury facilities, offering 360-degree views from sunrise over the Gold Coast beaches to sunset behind the mountain ranges. Our Mt Tamborine location provides a stunning backdrop for unforgettable weddings.
